+/* Answerer S1 detector based on phase steps. S1 shows up as consecutive phase steps of alternating sign. Before the
+   channel is equalised the S1 points sit only ~57 degrees apart instead of
+   90, so whether the stock 00/11 quadrant check sees any 00/11 pair depends
+   on the call's random carrier phase: it missed a clean S1 in ~40% of calls,
